# Use the physical 1440x3200 panel mode before the Qualcomm display HAL
# publishes its active configuration.  The stock-derived value is 1080x2400,
# which makes the Lineage composer select the wrong mode and can trigger the
# SDE framedone timeout during the first DRM commit.
on early-boot
    setprop persist.sys.miui_resolution 1440,3200,450
    setprop vendor.display.mixer_resolution 1440,3200,450
